Fallen to about 5 and 1 1.

478
00:19:51,720 --> 00:19:53,840
So you see the bond price went up.

479
00:19:53,840 --> 00:19:57,240
And when that happens, the interest rate goes from about 11%

480
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:59,320
to about 5.5%.

